# Committed intentionally — none of these are secrets. VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# is a publishable key by design (Supabase's anon key is meant to ship in the
# client bundle; RLS is the actual access boundary, not keeping this hidden),
# and the URL/backend origin are just public endpoints. Vite loads this file
# automatically on `vite build` (mode=production) — no Vercel dashboard env
# var configuration needed for the frontend.
